---
description: AbanteCart project conventions and which skills to load
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is AbanteCart (PHP ecommerce). Before writing or reviewing code, read the matching skill in `.agents/skills/`.

- Architecture / routing / lifecycle → `abantecart-architecture`
- Controllers, models, views, language XML → `abantecart-mvc`
- Extensions, install/update, hooks → `abantecart-extensions`
- Database, `DB_PREFIX`, schema, upgrades → `abantecart-database`
- Config, settings, cache, events, tasks → `abantecart-config-cache-tasks`
- Resource library → `abantecart-resource-library`
- Multi-store or multi-language → `abantecart-multistore-language`
- Forms, validation, escaping, CSRF → `abantecart-security`

Do not edit core to customize. Implement changes as extensions. Always use `$this->db->table()` for table names. Follow `.aiassistant/rules/abantecart_v1.md` for language XML, `echo_html2view`/`js_echo`, and thin controllers.
